~ food_poisoning
Book: One of your villagers got food poisoning.
- Treat him/her
	%90 Book: The villager has recovered and you used 1 Herb in the process.
	%9 Book: The treatment was unsuccessful and the villager is incapable. You used 1 Herb in the process.
	% Book:The treatment was unsuccessful and the villager died anyway. You lost 1 Herb in the process.
- Let him/her be
	%45 The villager remains sick and is incapable.
	%4 The villager died of food poisoning.
	% The villager regained health without treatment.
